{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:99130","published":"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-24T09:45:03.396754056Z","related":["CVE-2026-108094"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-108094"],"summary":"Important: mutter security update","details":"Mutter is a compositing window manager that displays and manages desktop through OpenGL. It combines the window-management logic inherited from the Metacity window manager with a display engine that uses the Clutter toolkit.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * mutter: mutter: client-triggered use-after-free in Wayland color-management ICC image description path (CVE-2026-108094)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"mutter","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/mutter"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"49.4-6.el10_3.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:99130.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mutter-common","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/mutter-common"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"49.4-6.el10_3.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:99130.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mutter-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/mutter-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"49.4-6.el10_3.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:99130.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:99130"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-108094"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https:/